# >>> simplex
# Needs the listing linux.simplex-chat on main (S3's recipe and the owner's
# static build).
# Not rehearsed: rehearse it once the listing lands, then keep or fix it.
# ==== 7a. Talk without being watched: SimpleX ================================
key:ctrl+alt+t
pause:3
type:market install linux.simplex-chat
say:SimpleX Chat, from the Marketplace: no account, no phone number.
key:ret
after:[LINUX] installed:1800
pause:2
type:linux simplex-chat
key:ret
pause:15
say:Its box lets it reach servers only over Nym or Anyone, never directly.
pause:8
type:/quit
key:ret
pause:3
say:
key:ctrl+l
# <<< simplex

